        "sha256": "f3bfc91f46060de47beca5bd47fefc04dc525b6bf2b31e753e70f7b1dee8e66f",
        "bytes": 307,
        "text_sanitized": "Start the specified machine(s), by ID or name.\n\nIf no machines are specified, the command will start all machines that were running when it was last stopped.\n\nUsage:\n  orbctl start [flags] [ID/NAME]...\n\nExamples:\n  orbctl start ubuntu\n\nFlags:\n  -a, --all    Start all machines\n  -h, --help   help for start\n"
      },
      ".stderr": {
